    /* ---------- The big word in depth ----------
       Solid letters with a side to them (stacked shadows, from pale to deep navy), turned a little towards
       the pointer: --hx, --hy the turn in degrees, --ex, --ey the side's direction (it shows away from the
       pointer), --g where the light crosses (0 to 100 along the word). At rest they lean back a touch, the
       light off the word. The script only runs on desktop with a mouse and motion allowed; otherwise the
       letters keep their resting depth. */
